<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Group, Sinora suspended.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Group, Sinora suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Berjaya Group Bhd, Sinora Industries Bhd and Goh Ban Huat Bhd have been suspended, an official of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>She said the reason for the suspension of the shares was not known immediately.</p>
</text>
